{"id":"n62386-2-8","stage":1,"title":"이유 · 理由","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62386-2-8-1","ko":"몸이 아파 좀 늦었습니다.","zh":"我身体不舒服，所以来晚了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"몸이","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아파","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늦었습니다.","meaning":"晚，迟到","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61181","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟到","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"61181","definition":"过了已定的时间。","pronunciation":["늗따"]}],"audio":"/audio/2ba27544d6bbb741da98.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62386-2-8-2","ko":"자네는 매번 무슨 이유가 그리 많나?","zh":"你每次怎么总有这么多借口呢？","note":