5f35a.mp3","entryId":"62386","definition":"为了不对已发生的事情负责而找的借口或辩解。","pronunciation":["이ː유"]},{"id":"6e85218c16f15307","term":"그리","zh":"那么，如此","audio":"/audio/6e85218c16f15307eb3f.mp3","entryId":"36302","definition":"状态、形状、性质等都那样地。","pronunciation":["그리"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/41104cb1d62aafda9a34.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.76,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62386","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":49,"sequenceScore":2.1605,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我身体不舒服，所以来晚了。","你每次怎么总有这么多借口呢？","承奎，这是什么字啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我身体不舒服，所以来晚了。","你每次怎么总有这么多借口呢？","承奎，这是什么字啊？"],"answer":1}]}
